# v1.0.3

## English

### Highlights

- **TTFX Text Effects** — New TTFX text-effect engine: create animated text with per-character effects, configurable resolution presets (480P–4K / portrait / square), export to video or transparent GIF, and a **typewriter reveal** mode for progressive word/character display.
- **Two New Filters** — **Liquid Glass**: frosted-glass rounded card with refraction, dispersion, blur and color grading (12 animatable parameters); **Wind Scatter**: particle breakup effect with wind direction, scatter distance, particle rotation and random seed.
- **Photo Dedup Tool** — New duplicate-photo finder with a three-stage pipeline (SHA-256 exact match, dHash perceptual, CLIP semantic), directory scanning, staged progress, cooperative cancel, and a full settings dialog (Ctrl+Alt+D).
- **Subtitle Search** — Instant subtitle/transcription search with live filtering and click-to-jump (Alt+F).
- **Upgrade Notifier** — UpdateDialog checks GitHub Releases API and notifies users when a newer version is available, with "don't ask again" persistence.

### Features

#### TTFX Text Effects
- TTFX live preview and recording with a configuration dialog (format / resolution / background color, loop count)
- Fixed resolution presets; font size scales by height to keep visuals consistent across presets
- Full-line cosmic-text layout: CJK glyphs keep natural width with per-character animation offsets
- Typewriter reveal: progressive character display by alignment (right-aligned plays in reverse), progress computation and rendering

#### GIF Export
- GIF export with transparent background (8-digit hex background color) and infinite loop; encoding runs on an async thread

#### New Filters
- **Liquid Glass**: rounded frosted-glass card with refraction, chromatic dispersion, blur and color grading; 12 animatable parameters; pixel params auto-scale to 1080p; preview radius drag handles
- **Wind Scatter**: wind direction, scatter distance, particle rotation and random seed; parameter panel, filter list and MCP service registration

#### Tools
- **Photo Dedup**: SHA-256 / dHash / CLIP three-stage pipeline; directory scan, staged progress, cooperative cancel; result sorting (errors > done, keep > move); settings dialog (thresholds, keep strategy, dup-dir name, CLIP model download)
- **Subtitle Search**: vertical layout (search box + virtual ListView), instant filter, click a result to seek to the subtitle start

#### Timeline & Editing
- Preview timeline **bookmarks**: rendered markers, left-click to jump, right-click menu (delete single / add or delete all with confirmation); persisted into project files
- **Non-linked segment deletion** (C shortcut): delete a segment without touching linked segments; toolbar button and icon
- **Subtitle track segment merge**: merge segments spanning the timeline regardless of gap/overlap, concatenating subtitle text

#### UI & System
- **Update dialog**: GitHub Releases API check, semantic version comparison, "don't ask again" persistence (config.skip-update-version)
- **Slint dynamic-z patch**: upgraded to slint 1.17.1 with dynamic z-ordering; move dialogs can be brought to front by clicking
- **Sub-menu support** for popup menus: AI tools regrouped into Video / Image / Audio sub-menus; new "Text to Speech" toolbar button
- **Preview edit-mode toggle** (E shortcut): temporarily hide the overlays to inspect the raw render
- **Arch Linux packaging** (PKGBUILD + pkg-arch.sh) and Makefile target

### Improvements

- Waveform precision setting (Low 15 / Medium 25 / High 30) with on-change refresh of all segment waveforms
- Snap lookup precision setting (Low / Medium / High / Ultra), snap search throttled by precision factor
- SRT timestamp support without the hours field; timeline end-slot judgment fixed to append the final time label
- Chinese numeral conversion: thousand separators (1000 → 1,000) and decimal scenarios (三点一四 → 3.14)
- Audio waveform sample rate raised from 15 Hz to 30 Hz
- Status bar draggable toggle and clicked/top-z callbacks; move dialog click-to-front via dynamic z
- Subtitle list virtual viewport keeps a margin before culling

### Bug Fixes

- **Transparent GIF export**: text no longer gets a black outline — blend_pixel now uses proper source-over alpha blending
- **TTFX recording**: fixed black preview and progress stuck at 99%; save dialog is shown on stop
- **Photo Dedup**: fixed wrong scan-directory existence check that gated the settings dialog
- **Project title**: closing a project now resets the project name instead of leaving the old name in the window title
- **Timeline tail slot**: fixed last-slot detection so the final time label is rendered
- Deleted segment no longer leaves stale selected-filter / edit-mode state; focus resets cleanly
- Transcribe separator removal keeps digits' commas

